  "private": true,
  "description": "Roadmap 0.12 R02 (spec 089): the one fixed, deterministic performance fixture — an on-disk libSQL database with a documented dataset — that records database calls, latency distributions, memory and admin list-render cost, and gates the regression budgets in budgets.json. Local measurement only; not deployed.",
